# Environment variables for Stable Diffusion project
# DO NOT commit this file to GitHub — it's already in .gitignore

# Not required for the public "runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5" model used in this notebook.
# Only needed later if you switch to a GATED or PRIVATE HuggingFace model
# (e.g. some newer SDXL/SD3 checkpoints that require accepting a license on HuggingFace).
# Get your token from: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=your-huggingface-access-token-here
